The 15s live pulse logged one "scoreboard <league>: window ok" line per
competition per tick — 32 lines every 15 seconds — which buried the auth
failures in the Render logs. Success is now silent and only failures speak:
the FAILED lines in the sync loops and the [auth:guest] VERIFICATION FAILED
diagnostic are untouched. The temporary auth probe (server) and the client
console dumps that printed Telegram initData are gone too; the enterApp
console.error stays.

